WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.733
Okay!

00:00:00.733 --> 00:00:03.767
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:04.367
A.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.000
Volleyball,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.600
B.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.200
Cricket,

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:06.800
C.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.433
Sleet,

00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:08.633
or D.

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:09.233
Rugby?

00:00:09.233 --> 00:00:10.467
Five seconds!

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:16.900
TIME'S UP!

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:18.700
The answer is...

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.133
C,

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:19.600
sleet!

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.033
Rugby,

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:20.500
volleyball,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.767
and cricket are all sports.

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:25.467
Sleet is a kind of weather,

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.733
so it does not belong.

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.367
Here's one,

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:31.033
a picture puzzle!

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:34.333
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:34.900
A.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.467
Top,

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:36.000
B.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:36.567
Bottom,

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.100
C.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:37.667
Left,

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:38.767
or D.

00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:39.333
Top-right?

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:40.433
Five seconds!

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:46.867
TIME'S UP!

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.567
The answer is...

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:48.967
B,

00:00:48.967 --> 00:00:49.400
bottom!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.900
The dot moves two spots clockwise

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.000
around the grid each step,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.500
so the next spot is bottom.

00:00:57.033 --> 00:00:58.400
Here's one,

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.467
a number series!

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:01.167
Three,

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:01.833
five,

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:02.533
eight,

00:01:02.533 --> 00:01:03.200
twelve,

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:03.900
seventeen,

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.267
and then...

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:07.333
what comes next?

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.000
A.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:08.700
Twenty-eight,

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:09.400
B.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.067
Twenty-three,

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:10.767
C.

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:11.433
Eighteen,

00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:12.800
or D.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.500
Twenty-one?

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.867
Five seconds!

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:21.333
TIME'S UP!

00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:23.000
The answer is...

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:23.433
B,

00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:23.833
twenty-three!

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.333
The gaps grow by the same

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:27.600
amount each step,

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.100
so the next number is twenty-three.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:30.967
So,

00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:32.767
are you smart or fart?

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:34.967
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:34.967 --> 00:01:36.033
find your rank!

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:36.867
So,

00:01:36.867 --> 00:01:38.100
how did you do?

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.333
Comment your score below,

00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:40.567
and follow for more!
